  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "견고라스로 하자니까!\n폭군포켓몬이라니, 너무 멋있잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACACACE0B77CC2A4B85C0020D558C790B2C8AE4C0021000AD3EDAD70D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2C8002C0020B108BB340020BA4BC788C796C544002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 오빠 생각이고,\n아마루르가도 강하다구!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020C624BE600020C0DDAC01C774ACE0002C000AC544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B3C40020AC15D558B2E4AD6C002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님!\n견고라스와 아마루르가 중에<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어느 쪽이 더 좋으세요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D80021000AACACACE0B77CC2A4C6400020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC000020C911C5D000100001BE00000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020B3540020C88BC73CC138C694003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모르는 사람 의견은 필요 없어!\n난 턱화석을 사러 온 거라고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B974B2940020C0ACB78C0020C758ACACC7400020D544C6940020C5C6C5B40021000AB09C0020D131D654C11DC7440020C0ACB7EC0020C6280020AC70B77CACE0002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "애초에 동료가 될 포켓몬을\n결정하는 건 나야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n나쥬의 말도 들을 필요 없다고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C560CD08C5D00020B3D9B8CCAC000020B4200020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AACB0C815D558B2940020AC740020B098C57C002100100001BE01000AB098C96CC7580020B9D0B3C40020B4E4C7440020D544C6940020C5C6B2E4ACE0002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무해!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB34D574002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님! 아마루르가가 얼마나 강한지\n오빠한테 보여 주실 수 있나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D800210020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00AC000020C5BCB9C8B0980020AC15D55CC9C0000AC624BE60D55CD14C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC2E40020C2180020C788B098C694003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가 1마리로\n오빠의 포켓몬을 이겨 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8B974AC0000200031B9C8B9ACB85C000AC624BE60C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C774ACA80020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가에 대해서는 제가 잘 알아요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n지느러미화석을\n아마루스로 복원시켜서 키우면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아마루르가로 진화하게 돼요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00C5D00020B300D574C11CB2940020C81CAC000020C7980020C54CC544C694002100100001BE01000AC9C0B290B7ECBBF8D654C11DC744000AC544B9C8B8E8C2A4B85C0020BCF5C6D0C2DCCF1CC11C0020D0A4C6B0BA7400100001BE00000AC544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B85C0020C9C4D654D558AC8C0020B3FCC694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가 1마리로 싸울 준비가 되면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8B974AC0000200031B9C8B9ACB85C0020C2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B418BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가에 대해서는 제가 잘 알아요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n지느러미화석을\n아마루스로 복원시켜서 키우면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아마루르가로 진화하게 돼요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아마루르가 1마리로 오빠를 이겨 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 싸울 거라면\n아마루르가 1마리만 데리고 와.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그게 동생이 바라는 거니까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020C2F8C6B80020AC70B77CBA74000AC544B9C8B8E8B974AC0000200031B9C8B9ACB9CC0020B370B9ACACE00020C640002E00100001BE00000AADF8AC8C0020B3D9C0DDC7740020BC14B77CB2940020AC70B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가 1마리만 데려 오셨군요!\n오빠와 승부해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8B974AC0000200031B9C8B9ACB9CC0020B370B8240020C624C168AD70C6940021000AC624BE60C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비하고 올게",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D558ACE00020C62CAC8C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강함을 증명하기 위해\n철저히 준비하시려는 거군요...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D568C7440020C99DBA85D558AE300020C704D574000ACCA0C800D7880020C900BE44D558C2DCB824B2940020AC70AD70C694002E002E002E002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강함을 증명해야 하니까\n봐주지 말고 싸워 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D568C7440020C99DBA85D574C57C0020D558B2C8AE4C000ABD10C8FCC9C00020B9D0ACE00020C2F8C6CC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대가 누구든 상관없어!\n아마루르가가 아무리 강해 봤자<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n내 포켓몬이 훨씬 더 강할걸!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300AC000020B204AD6CB4E00020C0C1AD00C5C6C5B40021000AC544B9C8B8E8B974AC00AC000020C544BB34B9AC0020AC15D5740020BD24C79000100001BE00000AB0B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020D6E8C52C0020B3540020AC15D560AC78002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 굉장해요!\n역시 아마루르가는 강하다니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020AD49C7A5D574C6940021000AC5EDC2DC0020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B2940020AC15D558B2E4B2C8AE4C002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어때?\n오빠도 이제 납득이 가지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B54C003F000AC624BE60B3C40020C774C81C0020B0A9B4DDC7740020AC00C9C0003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루르가가 아니라\n이 트레이너가 강한 거잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00AC000020C544B2C8B77C000AC7740020D2B8B808C774B108AC000020AC15D55C0020AC70C796C544002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그, 그럴지도 모르지만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8002C0020ADF8B7F4C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...그러니까 다음에는 나쥬가\n아마루르가를 데리고 나한테 도전해 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020B2E4C74CC5D0B2940020B098C96CAC00000AC544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020B098D55CD14C0020B3C4C804D5740020BD10002E00100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 전까지는 아마루르가가 강하다는 걸\n인정하지 않을 거라고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C804AE4CC9C0B2940020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00AC000020AC15D558B2E4B2940020AC78000AC778C815D558C9C00020C54AC7440020AC70B77CACE0002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다는 건...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4B2940020AC74002E002E002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지느러미화석을 사 줄 테니까\n네가 잘 키워 보라는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0B290B7ECBBF8D654C11DC7440020C0AC0020C9040020D14CB2C8AE4C000AB124AC000020C7980020D0A4C6CC0020BCF4B77CB2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님!\n오빠와 승부해 주셔서 감사해요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D80021000AC624BE60C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 꼭 세계 제일의 아마루르가를\n키우고 말겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020AF2D0020C138ACC40020C81CC77CC7580020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B97C000AD0A4C6B0ACE00020B9D0ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아마루스!\n앞으로 잘 부탁해!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B9C8B8E8C2A40021000AC55EC73CB85C0020C7980020BD80D0C1D574002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나쥬와는 견고라스 vs 아마루르가로\n승부할 생각이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C96CC640B2940020ACACACE0B77CC2A40020007600730020C544B9C8B8E8B974AC00B85C000AC2B9BD80D5600020C0DDAC01C774C57C002100100002011401820000",
